shell {"status": "success", "content": [{"text": "Execution Summary:\nTotal commands: 1\nSuccessful: 1\nFailed: 0"}, {"text": "Command: cd /tmp/site && echo \"=== all class tokens containing new ===\" && grep -rho 'class=\"[^\"]*\"' --include=*.html . | tr ' ' '\\n' | grep -i 'new' | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn && echo \"=== context of New word ===\" && grep -rn 'New' --include=*.html . | head -60\nStatus: success\nExit Code: 0\nOutput: === all class tokens containing new ===\r\n     16 badge-new\"\r\n=== context of New word ===\r\n./kimi-k3-1-pro/index.html:106:<tr><td class=\"model-name\">kimi-k3.1-pro <span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span></td><td class=\"price\">$2.00</td><td class=\"price\">$10.00</td><td class=\"price\">$0.20</td><td class=\"price\">$2.00</td><td class=\"price\">$4.00</td></tr>\r\n./en/kimi-k3-1-pro/index.html:105:<tr><td class=\"model-name\">kimi-k3.1-pro <span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span></td><td class=\"price\">$2.00</td><td class=\"price\">$10.00</td><td class=\"price\">$0.20</td><td class=\"price\">$2.00</td><td class=\"price\">$4.00</td></tr>\r\n./en/claude-opus-5-5/index.html:212:<tr><td class=\"model-name\">New containment test</td><td>Attempted to circumvent boundaries about <strong>85% less often</strong> than Opus 5 or Mythos 5.1; every attempt was low severity and self-reported.</td></tr>\r\n./en/glossary/index.html:101:        <h3 class=\"card-title\"><span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span> The four data-protection requirements — \"not stored\", \"not seen\", \"not learned from\", \"not sent abroad\"</h3>\r\n./en/glossary/index.html:107:        <h3 class=\"card-title\"><span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span> What is zero operator access (ZOA)? — \"not retained\" and \"not viewable\" are different promises</h3>\r\n./en/glossary/index.html:113:        <h3 class=\"card-title\"><span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span> No-training explained — why one vendor gives two answers</h3>\r\n./en/glossary/index.html:119:        <h3 class=\"card-title\"><span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span> Data residency explained — “not sent abroad” is two promises</h3>\r\n./en/glossary/zero-data-retention/index.html:250:        But <strong>the list grows</strong>. New frontier models get added, so check the official page <strong>once before signing and once after onboarding</strong>.\r\n./en/qwen-3-8-flash/index.html:111:<p class=\"source-note\">Sources: <a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen3.8-flash-next\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Qwen blog \"Qwen3.8-Flash-Next: A New Architecture, Towards Ultimate Cost-Efficiency\"</a> · <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HuggingFace: Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next</a> (verified 2026-09-01)</p>\r\n./en/grok-4-7/index.html:6:  <title>Grok 4.7 — xAI&rsquo;s Larger New Flagship [Pricing, Benchmarks &amp; Comparison] — LLM Data Hub</title>\r\n./en/grok-4-7/index.html:22:  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Grok 4.7 — xAI&rsquo;s Larger New Flagship\">\r\n./en/grok-4-7/index.html:26:  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Grok 4.7 — xAI's Larger New Flagship [Pricing, Benchmarks & Comparison]\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-09-23\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-05\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"LLM Data Hub\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"okamo channel\"},\"url\":\"https://llm.okamomedia.tokyo/en/grok-4-7/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script>\r\n./en/claude-fable-5-1/index.html:26:  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Claude Fable 5.1 — Anthropic's New Mythos-Class Flagship [Pricing, Benchmarks & Comparison]\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-09-01\",\"dateModified\": \"2026-11-12\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"LLM Data Hub\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"okamo channel\"},\"url\":\"https://llm.okamomedia.tokyo/en/claude-fable-5-1/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script>\r\n./en/claude-fable-5-1/index.html:143:<tr><td class=\"model-name\">Claude Fable 5.1</td><td>Anthropic</td><td class=\"price\">$10.00</td><td class=\"price\">$50.00</td><td class=\"price\">$0.25</td><td>New flagship (Mythos-class)</td></tr>\r\n./en/gpt-6-sol-luna/index.html:84:  <tr><td class=\"model-name\"><strong>New (GPT-6 era)</strong></td><td><strong>GPT-6 Sol</strong></td><td class=\"price\"><strong>$2 / $10</strong></td><td><strong>This page</strong></td></tr>\r\n./en/gpt-6-sol-luna/index.html:85:  <tr><td class=\"model-name\"><strong>New (GPT-6 era)</strong></td><td><strong>GPT-6 Luna</strong></td><td class=\"price\"><strong>$0.10 / $0.50</strong></td><td><strong>This page</strong></td></tr>\r\n./en/china-ai/index.html:155:  <li><span class=\"cl-date\">2026-09-01</span><span class=\"cl-text\">Added Qwen3.8-Flash (Alibaba, released 2026-08-26): $0.15/$0.47 (international), 125B/6B active MoE, 256K→1M context, Qwen4 architecture preview — verified against qwen.ai/blog. New <a href=\"/en/qwen-3-8-flash/\">deep-dive page</a>.</span></li>\r\n./en/china-ai/index.html:156:  <li><span class=\"cl-date\">2026-08-31</span><span class=\"cl-text\">Added GLM 5.3 Flash (Z.ai, released 2026-08-26): list $0.15/$0.50 (the 50% intro promo $0.075/$0.25 ended 9/9), 320B/18B MoE, 1M context, MIT — verified against docs.z.ai and the Z.ai blog. New <a href=\"/en/glm-5-3-flash/\">deep-dive page</a>.</span></li>\r\n./en/mai/index.html:207:    <li><strong>Newest speech recognition (2026-10-02):</strong> MAI-Transcribe-2-Streaming transcribes 60 languages in streaming mode and returns a partial in about 100ms without waiting for the speaker to stop. Introductory price through the end of the year: $0.54/hour (official blog). It is not yet in the verified Azure pricing table.</li>\r\n./en/pricing/index.html:66:<tr><td class=\"model-name\">GPT-6.2 Astra</td><td class=\"price\">$8.00</td><td class=\"price\">$0.40</td><td class=\"price\">$40.00</td><td>New flagship (announced 2026-11-17). Long context $16.00/$0.80/$60.00. 20% cheaper in/out and 60% cheaper cached than GPT-6 Astra. Cache writes $10 (30m) / $20 (12h) <a href=\"/en/timeline/#gpt-6-2-astra-sol\" style=\"font-weight:700;\">→ timeline</a></td><td class=\"st-cell st-cur\">Current</td></tr>\r\n./en/pricing/index.html:70:<tr><td class=\"model-name\">GPT-6 Astra </td><td class=\"price\">$10.00</td><td class=\"price\">$1.00</td><td class=\"price\">$50.00</td><td>New flagship (announced 2026-09-03). Long: $20/$2/$75. Fast mode 2× <a href=\"/en/gpt-6/\" style=\"font-weight:700;\">→Deep dive</a></td><td class=\"st-cell st-cur\">Current</td></tr>\r\n./en/pricing/index.html:187:<div class=\"spotlight-card\"><span class=\"spotlight-badge\">🔍 Spotlight</span><h3>DeepSeek V4.1 Flash — steep price cuts and native vision; V4 Pro continues (9/14 notice withdrawn)</h3><p>V4.1 Flash costs far less than V4 Pro and adds native image input. It was initially announced that from 2026-09-14 every request — including those to <code>deepseek-v4-pro</code> — would route to V4.1 Flash, but <strong>DeepSeek withdrew that notice and confirmed V4 Pro continues</strong>. New rates: $0.15/$0.60 off-peak, $0.30/$1.20 peak (cache-miss input / output) — about 77% lower on input, 70% lower on output and 86% lower on cached input versus V4 Pro. Off-peak and weekend runs cut cost further. See the <a href=\"/en/deepseek-v4-1-flash/\">V4.1 Flash guide</a>, <a href=\"/en/deepseek-v4-pro/\">V4 Pro continuation</a> and the <a href=\"/en/calculator/\">calculator</a>.</p></div>\r\n./en/gpt-6/index.html:6:  <title>GPT-6 Astra — OpenAI's New Flagship [Pricing, Benchmarks &amp; Availability] — LLM Data Hub</title>\r\n./en/gpt-6/index.html:22:  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"GPT-6 Astra — OpenAI's New Flagship [Pricing, Benchmarks &amp; Availability]\">\r\n./en/gpt-6/index.html:26:  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"GPT-6 Astra — OpenAI's New Flagship [Pricing, Benchmarks & Availability]\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-09-03\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-09-15\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"LLM Data Hub\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"okamo channel\"},\"url\":\"https://llm.okamomedia.tokyo/en/gpt-6/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script>\r\n./en/gpt-6/index.html:44:  <p class=\"price-flag\">✨ New flagship — Standard $10/$50 (announced 2026-09-03)</p>\r\n./en/gpt-6/index.html:66:      <li><a href=\"#perf-h\">Performance — New Records Across Key Benchmarks</a></li>\r\n./en/gpt-6/index.html:125:<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"perf-h\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem;\">Performance — New Records Across Key Benchmarks</h2>\r\n./en/gpt-6/index.html:151:<tr><td class=\"model-name\">GPT-6 Astra</td><td>OpenAI</td><td class=\"price\">$10.00</td><td class=\"price\">$50.00</td><td>—</td><td>New flagship (baseline)</td></tr>\r\n./en/changelog/index.html:105:<li><span class=\"cl-date\">2026-08-21</span> <span class=\"cl-text\">Listed DeepSeek V4 Flash Vision Exp released (experimental) New (DeepSeek)</span></li>\r\n./en/changelog/index.html:106:<li><span class=\"cl-date\">2026-08-19</span> <span class=\"cl-text\">Listed GPT-5.6 Sol 50% off via Cloudflare AI Gateway New (OpenAI / Cloudflare)</span></li>\r\n./en/changelog/index.html:110:<li><span class=\"cl-date\">2026-07-31</span> <span class=\"cl-text\">Listed DeepSeek V4 Flash officially released (public beta) New (DeepSeek)</span></li>\r\n./en/changelog/index.html:113:<li><span class=\"cl-date\">2026-07-21</span> <span class=\"cl-text\">Listed Gemini 3.6 Flash, 3.5 Flash-Lite, 3.5 Flash Cyber released New (Google)</span></li>\r\n./en/timeline/index.html:49:<article class=\"tl-item dot-other\" id=\"kimi-k3-1-pro\"><div class=\"tl-card\"><div class=\"tl-date\">2026-10-23 <span class=\"tl-provider-tag\" style=\"background:rgba(203,213,225,.15);color:#cbd5e1;\">Moonshot</span></div><h2 class=\"tl-title\" id=\"sec-9\">Kimi K3.1 Pro series rolls out — 3T-class, 1M context</h2><p class=\"tl-desc\">First model in the new K3.1 series. In Kimi's own words, \"our most capable 3T-class model to date\", with a 1M-token context and stronger coding, 3D creation, financial research and long-horizon agent work. <strong>K3.1 Pro Highspeed</strong> ships alongside it at roughly 2-3x the speed with the same quality (K3.1 Pro on Plus/Moderato and above; Pro/Allegretto and above unlock up to 1M context; Highspeed on Pro/Allegretto and above). Thinking mode only: low/high/max, default high.  (2026-11-07 update: the official pricing page now has a <code>kimi-k3.1-pro</code> row: $2.00 input, $10.00 output, $0.20 cached input, 1,048,576 context, Batch at 60%.)<span class=\"tl-price-badge\">$2.00/$10.00 (cached $0.20)</span></p><div class=\"tl-links\"><a href=\"/en/kimi-k3-1-pro/\">Deep dive →</a><a href=\"https://www.kimi.com/code/docs/en/kimi-code/whats-new.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Official What's New →</a><a href=\"/en/china-ai/#labs-h\">China AI overview →</a></div></div></article>\r\n./en/timeline/index.html:79:<article class=\"tl-item dot-openai\" id=\"gpt-5-6\"><div class=\"tl-card\"><div class=\"tl-date\">2026-07-09 <span class=\"tl-provider-tag openai\">OpenAI</span></div><h2 class=\"tl-title\" id=\"sec-44\">GPT-5.6 family released — Sol / Terra / Luna</h2><p class=\"tl-desc\">New flagship Sol, balanced Terra, and fastest low-cost Luna released together. Terra/Luna price cuts on 7/30. <span class=\"tl-price-badge\">Sol $5/$30 · Terra $2/$12 · Luna $0.20/$1.20 (after 7/30)</span></p><div class=\"tl-links\"><a href=\"https://openai.com/index/gpt-5-6/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Official announcement →</a></div></div></article>\r\n./en/timeline/index.html:81:<article class=\"tl-item dot-anthropic\" id=\"claude-fable-5\"><div class=\"tl-card\"><div class=\"tl-date\">2026-06-09 <span class=\"tl-provider-tag anthropic\">Anthropic</span></div><h2 class=\"tl-title\" id=\"sec-46\">Claude Fable 5 / Mythos 5 released — new &quot;Mythos class&quot; tier</h2><p class=\"tl-desc\">New tier above Opus. Fable 5 general availability, Mythos 5 limited. Paused 6/12 â restored 7/1. <span class=\"tl-price-badge\">Fable 5 $10.00/$50.00</span></p><div class=\"tl-links\"><a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-fable-5-mythos-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Official announcement â</a></div></div></article>\r\n./en/multimodal/index.html:178:<tr><td class=\"model-name\">Realtime speech dialogue<br><small>Live / Realtime</small><span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span></td><td><strong>Gemini 3.8 Live</strong><br><strong>Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking</strong><br>Gemini 3.1 Flash Live Preview<br>Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio</td><td>audioâaudio</td><td class=\"price\">3.8 Live / 3.8 Live Extended Thinking / 3.1 Flash Live Preview (one shared price table):<br>input text $0.75 Â· audio $3.00 ($0.005/min) Â· image/video $1.00 ($0.002/min)<br>output text $4.50 Â· audio $12.00 ($0.018/min)<br><small>Output includes thinking tokens</small></td><td><a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google pricing</a> Â· <a href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/gemini-3-8-live-gemini-3-8-live-extended-thinking/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blog</a></td></tr>\r\n./en/multimodal/index.html:180:<tr><td class=\"model-name\">Image generation / edit</td><td>Gemini Nano Banana 2.1 <span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span><br>Gemini 3.1 Flash Image (Nano Banana 2)<br>Gemini 3 Pro Image (Nano Banana Pro)</td><td>imageâimage</td><td class=\"price\">Nano Banana 2.1: 1K=$0.0336 Â· 2K=$0.0504 Â· 4K=$0.113 per image ($7.50/M text + $30/M images)<br>Flash Image: $60/M (1K=$0.067) Â· Pro Image: $120/M (1K=$0.134)</td><td><a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a></td></tr>\r\n./en/multimodal/index.html:181:<tr><td class=\"model-name\">Speech generation (TTS)<span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span></td><td><strong>Gemini 3.8 Flash TTS</strong><br><strong>Gemini 3.8 Flash-Lite TTS</strong><br>Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS Preview</td><td>textâaudio</td><td class=\"price\">3.8 Flash TTS: text in $0.50 / audio out $9.00<br>3.8 Flash-Lite TTS: text in $0.50 / audio out $6.00<br><small>Both priced through 2026-12-31; $1.00/$18.00 and $1.00/$12.00 from 2027-01-01</small><br>3.1 Flash TTS Preview: text in $1.00 / audio out $20.00</td><td><a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a></td></tr>\r\n./en/deepseek-v4-1-flash/index.html:590:        <p style=\"font-size:.88rem;color:var(--c-muted);\">A. Those names are still accepted for compatibility, but the underlying models are retired: requests are served by V4.1 Flash and billed at the V4.1 Flash price. New code should use <code>deepseek-flash</code>.</p>\r\n./en/grok-4-6/index.html:6:  <title>Grok 4.6 — xAI's New Flagship for Coding &amp; Agents [Pricing, Benchmarks &amp; Comparison] — LLM Data Hub</title>\r\n./en/grok-4-6/index.html:22:  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Grok 4.6 — xAI's New Flagship for Coding &amp; Agents\">\r\n./en/grok-4-6/index.html:26:  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Grok 4.6 — xAI's New Flagship for Coding & Agents [Pricing, Benchmarks & Comparison]\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-08-17\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-05\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"LLM Data Hub\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"okamo channel\"},\"url\":\"https://llm.okamomedia.tokyo/en/grok-4-6/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script>\r\n./glossary/index.html:98:        <h3 class=\"card-title\"><span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span> データを守る4要件とは — 「残さない・見せない・学ばせない・出さない」</h3>\r\n./glossary/index.html:104:        <h3 class=\"card-title\"><span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span> ZOA（ゼロオペレーターアクセス）とは — 「保存しない」と「見られない」は別の約束</h3>\r\n./glossary/index.html:110:        <h3 class=\"card-title\"><span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span> 学習に使わせない（no-training）とは — 「無料で試す」と「契約して使う」で答えが変わる</h3>\r\n./glossary/index.html:116:        <h3 class=\"card-title\"><span class=\"badge badge-new\">New</span> 出さない（データレジデンシー）とは — データが国外に出ない＝「保存」と「処理」は別の約束</h3>\r\n./qwen-3-8-flash/index.html:111:<p class=\"source-note\">出典: <a href=\"https://qwen.ai/blog?id=qwen3.8-flash-next\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Qwen公式ブログ「Qwen3.8-Flash-Next: A New Architecture, Towards Ultimate Cost-Efficiency」</a> · <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HuggingFace: Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next</a>（2026-09-01確認）</p>\r\n./changelog/index.html:80:<li><span class=\"cl-date\">2026-10-13</span> <span class=\"cl-text\">Gemini 4 Argon 公開（GA）— 1Mコンテキストのフラッグシップ推論モデル New を掲載（Google）</span></li>\r\n./changelog/index.html:105:<li><span class=\"cl-date\">2026-08-21</span> <span class=\"cl-text\">DeepSeek V4 Flash Vision Exp 公開（実験的モデル） New を掲載（DeepSeek）</span></li>\r\n./changelog/index.html:106:<li><span class=\"cl-date\">2026-08-19</span> <span class=\"cl-text\">Cloudflare AI GatewayでGPT-5.6 Solが50%オフ New を掲載（OpenAI / Cloudflare）</span></li>\r\n./changelog/index.html:110:<li><span class=\"cl-date\">2026-07-31</span> <span class=\"cl-text\">DeepSeek V4 Flash 公式リリース（public beta） New を掲載（DeepSeek）</span></li>\r\n./changelog/index.html:113:<li><span class=\"cl-date\">2026-07-21</span> <span class=\"cl-text\">Gemini 3.6 Flash・3.5 Flash-Lite・3.5 Flash Cyber 公開 New を掲載（Google）</span></li>\r\n./timeline/index.html:49:<article class=\"tl-item dot-other\" id=\"kimi-k3-1-pro\"><div class=\"tl-card\"><div class=\"tl-date\">2026-10-23 <span class=\"tl-provider-tag\" style=\"background:rgba(203,213,225,.15);color:#cbd5e1;\">Moonshot</span></div><h2 class=\"tl-title\" id=\"sec-9\">Kimi K3.1 Pro シリーズ提供開始 